--- a/hexagonrpcd/hexagonrpcd.1
+++ b/hexagonrpcd/hexagonrpcd.1
@@ -18,7 +18,9 @@
 FastRPC device node to attach to
 .TP
 \fB\-p \fIPROGRAM\fP
-Run client program with shared file descriptor
+Run client program with shared file descriptor. The listener exits after all
+clients finish. A client or listener failure produces a nonzero exit status.
+Client and listener processes are killed when the session parent exits.
 .TP
 \fB\-R \fIDIR\fP
 Root directory of served files (default: /usr/share/qcom/)
